 <PersonaRadarChart {park} {weights} selectedPersona={persona}/><details class="weights"><summary>Category scores, weights and coverage</summary>{#each selectedWeights as weight}<div><span>{weight.label}<small>Weight {weight.overall_weight_pct.toFixed(2)}%</small></span><strong>{formatNumber(valueFor(park,weight.score_field))}<small>Coverage {pct(valueFor(park,weight.coverage_field))}</small></strong></div>{/each}<p>A zero weight means no contribution to the overall persona score; it does not describe accessibility or facility availability.</p></details>
 <h3>Park & demographic context</h3><dl class="demographic-grid"><div><dt>Area</dt><dd>{formatNumber(park.properties.area_ha,2)}{park.properties.area_ha!==null?' ha':''}</dd></div><div><dt>Nearby population</dt><dd>{people(park.properties.catchment_population)}</dd></div><div><dt>Family age share</dt><dd>{pct(park.properties.family_age_share_pct)}</dd></div><div><dt>Student age share</dt><dd>{pct(park.properties.young_age_share_pct)}</dd></div><div><dt>Elderly age share</dt><dd>{pct(park.properties.pensioner_age_share_pct)}</dd></div><div><dt>Priority points</dt><dd>{formatNumber(park.properties.demographic_priority_points)}</dd></div><div><dt>Priority rank</dt><dd>{formatNumber(park.properties.demographic_priority_rank,0)}</dd></div><div><dt>Adjusted index</dt><dd>{formatNumber(park.properties.demographic_adjusted_index)}</dd></div></dl>
 <details class="detailed-demographics"><summary>Detailed demographic analysis</summary><dl><div><dt>Age-weighted quality</dt><dd>{formatNumber(park.properties.age_weighted_quality)}</dd></div><div><dt>Family gap points</dt><dd>{formatNumber(park.properties.family_gap_points)}</dd></div><div><dt>Young gap points</dt><dd>{formatNumber(park.properties.young_gap_points)}</dd></div><div><dt>Pensioner gap points</dt><dd>{formatNumber(park.properties.pensioner_gap_points)}</dd></div><div><dt>Estimated population · 0–14</dt><dd>{people(park.properties.family_estimated_population)}</dd></div><div><dt>Estimated population · 15–29</dt><dd>{people(park.properties.young_estimated_population)}</dd></div><div><dt>Estimated population · 65+</dt><dd>{people(park.properties.pensioner_estimated_population)}</dd></div><div><dt>Catchment population</dt><dd>{people(park.properties.catchment_population)}</dd></div><div><dt>Catchment cells</dt><dd>{formatNumber(park.properties.catchment_cells,0)}</dd></div><div><dt>DeSO areas represented</dt><dd>{formatNumber(park.properties.catchment_deso_count,0)}</dd></div><div><dt>Total selected age-group share</dt><dd>{pct(park.properties.age_groups_share_pct)}</dd></div></dl><p>Age-weighted quality: higher means better modelled quality for the selected age mix. Priority rank 1 means greatest potential priority. Null demographic values remain unavailable, not zero.</p></details>
 <p class="method-note">Demographics are estimated within 300 m straight-line catchments, not walking-distance catchments or observed visitors. Priority is exploratory, not an intervention recommendation.</p>{#if booleanFor(park,provisionalField(persona))}<p class="provisional-note">This persona score is provisional.</p>{/if}
